GPTcar is an independent adaptation of Lemo-Opuscar by Lemomo / LemoLab.
Upstream: https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar
Baseline: ded40b25679fe5d5dcfc07a282a25da1ceee3be1 (reviewed 2026-10-18).

The original 51 style prompts, production guides, toolkit, gallery and demo
films were created by the upstream contributors. The demos were authored with
Claude Opus 5.5; they are not evidence of Codex-generated output.

The GPTcar adaptation adds Codex skill discovery, setup and installation,
compatibility documentation and validation. Original copyright notices and
the MIT license are retained in LICENSE. Third-party assets retain their own
licenses; consult each demo's CREDITS and the asset source notices.

GPTcar is not an official OpenAI, Anthropic or LemoLab product.
Historical Claude plugin files and gallery pages remain upstream artifacts;
the Codex entry point is .agents/skills/gptcar/SKILL.md.
